<title>BOTSWANA: TABLE - RDC Props pretax income rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - RDC Props pretax income rises.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			(million pula unless stated)</p>
<p>    Div (thebe)		 0.14    vs    0.16</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     2.74    vs    2.51</p>
<p>    Tax			   0.15    vs    0.14</p>
<p>    Turnover		    4.52    vs    3.83</p>
<p>    Interest income	   0.02    vs    0.36</p>
<p>Div payable November 3</p>
<p>on register at October 24</p>
<p>Full name: RDC Properties Linmited</p>
<p>NOTE - The directors said the period showed a continuing strong performance with income before interest and taxation up 22.6 percent.</p>
<p>The anticipated increase in the demand for commercial and retail space was slowly having an effect on the company with a reduction in vacancy levels and an increase in rental income.</p>
<p>The increase in the commercial sector of the market was still lagging behind when viewed against the upswing recorded in the residential sector and this indicated a progressive re-adjustment in this sector, it said.</p>
